    "https://www.barclaycollege.edu/jobs/job/first-christian-church-leavenworth-ks-kc-metro-outlying-city-full-time-senior-pastor/": {
      "title": "Find your next opportunity.",
      "description": "Senior Pastor – Barclay College Jobs Job Board College website ↗ Barclay College community opportunities Find your next opportunity. Browse openings shared for Barclay students and alumni. Employers and ministry partners may create an account and submit a position for review. Posting a position? Create an account, submit the details, and Barclay College will review the listing before it appears. Submit a job → Back to all jobs Leavenworth KS (KC metro outlying city) Posted 2 months ago Website First Christian Church First Christian Church in Leavenworth, Kansas is seeking a Senior Pastor, and we would appreciate your help in sharing this opportunity with qualified candidates. We are a well-established congregation of more than 150 years on the northwest edge of the Kansas City metro area. We are affiliated with the Christian Church (Disciples of Christ), but in the spirit of our belief that “we are Christians only, but not the only Christians,” we are also open to considering Protestant ministers from outside Christian Church-affiliated schools. More information about our congregation can be found at www.leavenworthchristian.com. All inquiries and applications must go through Kansas Disciples. Interested applicants should use the Search and Call portal linked below. Thank you for passing this along to candidates who may be a good fit. To apply for this job please visit www.discipleshomemissions.org . Barclay College Job Board Opportunities for students, alumni, and the wider Barclay community. Browse jobs Submit a job Contact Barclay College website © 2026 Barclay College · 607 N. Kingman, Haviland, KS 67059"
